From 4099754d22849c1db34438b66c0296ed57581d0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eugen <eugen252009@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:22:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] fs: add attenuating and independently cloned file
 capabilities

Add regular-file bitmap query/restriction/clone operations and shared-description lifetime/use checks. Keep source-context and cached-LSM preservation hooks and enforcing implementations together with the clone operation so the series does not advertise an unguarded derivation. Include the adjacent vfs_link_path declaration from the same existing fs.h change; its implementation follows next.
